{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">向來保養得宜的凍齡女神陳自瑤（Yoyo）近日大派福利，拍攝了一輯極具古典美的旗袍靚相，完美展現出獨特的東方女性魅力與優雅氣質，靚到令一眾網民心心眼。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692373536148832_631179648.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026QDtZN5mCXO1790321219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692373536148832_631179648.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">相中可見，Yoyo 悉心打扮，身穿一套深紫色的無袖旗袍，貼身剪裁完美勾勒出她零贅肉的纖瘦身段。最令網民暴動的，莫過於旗袍兩側的高衩設計！當 Yoyo 優雅地坐在戶外木椅上時，大方展露出一雙白滑修長的美腿，配搭一雙閃亮的銀色高跟幼帶鞋，性感之中不失高貴，女人味極度濃厚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692369601716269_631179648.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Xy0QYGBamr1790321219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692369601716269_631179648.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">為了配合這身古典打扮，Yoyo 更準備了精緻的道具點綴，包括一把畫有白色花朵圖案的半透明圓扇，以及一個黑色的復古金屬扣小手袋。她時而拿着圓扇半遮面，散發出一絲神祕誘惑感；時而雙手托腮倚在白色木窗邊，展露甜美溫婉的招牌笑容。其中一張相片的背景更掛着寫有「韻味融古今」的字畫，完美呼應了 Yoyo 身上那股融合現代與古典的美感。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692271983504025_631179648.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026rHxfK6b2WF1790321219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692271983504025_631179648.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692361900951396_631179648.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MUz8Sw2mI61790321219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"chenchiyiu_1790306613_3993692361900951396_631179648.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T08:18:12.600032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}